[10.277928, "o", "ð¬ Claude: ## My Approach\r\r\n\r\r\nI'll create a simple Go program in `it_works/keccac.go` that reads a file path from command-line arguments, opens the file, streams its contents through Go's `crypto/sha3.New256()` hasher (which implements Keccak-256), and outputs the hex-encoded hash. The program will use `io.Copy` for efficient streaming of large files and proper error handling.\r\r\n\r\r\n**Shall I begin?**\r\r\n"]
